data: {"id": "52af63c2ca3d4f4b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1164", "run_id": "52af63c2ca3d4f4b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将根据已有的首轮可观测性结果，执行剩余的 Kubernetes 层验证工具，以完成根因诊断。\n\n**已采集事实概览：**\n1.  **Metrics**: Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`last_terminated_reason=Error`，重启 19 次。\n2.  **Logging**: 日志中连续出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误，HTTP 500，随后进程退出。\n3.  **Tracing**: DeepFlow 和 Tempo 追踪到针对 `/work` 端点的 GET 请求返回 500，且 Span 属性中明确标记 `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit`。\n\n**下一步计划**：执行 `kubectl_describe`、`kubectl_previous_logs`、`kubectl_get_yaml`、`kubectl_events` 以获取具体的退出码、命令配置和 Kubernetes 事件。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788448760854, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

