的特定配置项（关键配置缺失，具体名称未知）导致启动或处理请求失败，以退出码 78 异常终止，进而引发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启循环。\n- **证据**：日志聚合 `CONFIG_MISSING`（证据 #4）与 Trace Span `config_missing_exit`（证据 #8）一致；K8s 状态显示退出码为 78（证据 #3）及 BackOff 事件（证据 #2）。\n- **缺失事实**：尚未确定缺失的具体配置项名称（如 ConfigMap key 或环境变量名）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 75.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 75.9s (Evidence 66.2s, RCA 9.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 115.78, "metrics": {"run_id": "52af63c2ca3d4f4b", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 115.79644227027893, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "58%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 100%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 115796.44227027893, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 90607.69248008728, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 51633.31913948059, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 24684.917449951172}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 27512.190341949463, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 75913.31028938293, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12336.72571182251, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

